import ImbalancedChen.P5HistoricalMask56FullSourceChildren

/-!
SOURCE ONLY / UNCOMPILED / ZERO FORMAL CREDIT.

The original subdivision producer's full loop runs split_bound on EVERY
parent and stores max(old, complete64childsum). F already supplies the
closed child-fact requests when ownerLicenseCheck=true. These143 new
closed requests concern ONLY the complementary source positions.
ownerLicenseCheck is a THIRD-history pair licence, not the fifth mask.

The source rows, original frozen parent planes, reconstructed child
integer d/A/B, and arbitrary-mask Jensen receiver are all reused.
No archive values are transcribed and no numerical producer is executed.
All finite bodies here and in the predecessor remain UNEVALUATED; binary
authenticity, feasibility and kernel acceptance are separate obligations.
-/
